{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓全國多地近日受強降雨天氣影響，造成至少23人死亡，受災人數超過500萬人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FLOOD-1830.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZU2h4W6jOo1786960719.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FLOOD-1830.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在首都馬尼拉東部地區，道路嚴重水浸，汽車與行人都涉水而行，亦有電單車司機推車前行，部分地方水深高過膝蓋。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FLOOD-1830_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261LCZ9oJzJI1786960733.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FLOOD-1830_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓民防局表示，連日的強降雨亦引發洪水及山泥傾瀉。全國有10個行政區受嚴重影響，受災民眾大部分在北部呂宋島，中部及南部亦有部分地方受災嚴重。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T10:10:14.800692+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}